  "description": "<p>The Drip Sofa is sleek, stylish, and effortlessly comfortable. Designed with a clean, modern vibe, the Drip Sofa is here to instantly level up your living space. Upholstered in premium performance-woven fabric and built on a sturdy solid wood frame, it’s made for real everyday living; stylish and durable. The elevated legs give it that light, airy look while making under-sofa cleaning super easy (because nobody likes dust!).\nCrafted with 317 GSM performance fabric engineered to withstand over 50,000 rub cycles, this sofa doesn’t just look good, it’s designed to give you main character vibes.</p>\n\n<p>For the comfort crowd, the Drip Sofa totally delivers. The deep seats, plush removable back cushions, and supportive high-density foam, lets you sink in and switch off after a long day. The floating-arm design adds a sleek, statement look while still keeping things cozy and inviting.</p>\n\n<p>Available in 1, 2, and 3-seater variants, the Drip Sofa adapts seamlessly to homes of every size. Whether you’re entertaining guests, lounging with your pet, or creating a stylish nook in your home office, the Drip Sofa blends, it blends comfort and style effortlessly.</p>\n\n<p>Choose from two snatched shades: a warm Sandstone Beige or the rich, statement-making Pine Green, to complement your decor effortlessly. Backed by a 3-year conditional warranty, the Drip Sofa is a perfect mix of comfort, function, and timeless modern design.</p>",
